	"Name": "Kenneth's Restaurant",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[b]Adds a new constructible building - Kenneth's Restaurant (built by Robin) - with 49 custom restaurant foods to buy, each with its own cooking recipe and buffs![/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Customization: By default, all foods appear in the shop. If you prefer a smaller menu and have Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM) installed, you can disable individual foods to remove them from the shop along with their cooking recipes. Re-enabling a food restores it to the shop and its recipe to your kitchen.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Please do not reupload this mod or include it in modpacks without permission.[/b]",
